(4885922, 708531, 47791, '<td valign="top">A great pictue. is it meant to be so dark and foreboding? It makes you think the ducky is in for a bad time.</td>', 'A great pictue. is it meant to be so dark and foreboding? It makes you think the ducky is in for a bad time.', '2008-08-13 14:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
