(4889691, 708855, 96762, '<td valign="top">now thats a big white border!  I like the image, it''s a bit small though.  I like the scull and crossbones in the background.  It''s an interesting contrast.  Curious why you chose to put such a big white border around though.  <br/>Could have used a bit of foreground lighting as well.</td>', 'now thats a big white border!  I like the image, it''s a bit small though.  I like the scull and crossbones in the background.  It''s an interesting contrast.  Curious why you chose to put such a big white border around though.  Could have used a bit of foreground lighting as well.', '2008-08-15 01:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889694, 708157, 96762, '<td valign="top">the second "untitled" photo in this challenge so far.  Thats irritating.  Why not come up with a title?  A title is meant to convey something about the image from the photographer, to the viewer.  What are you going for here?<br/>It''s an interesting shot, I just wish you had a title.  Needs a bit of contrast, levels/curves adjustment.  Not sure if I have ever seen a little ducky with no eyes.  lol  where did you find that?</td>', 'the second "untitled" photo in this challenge so far.  Thats irritating.  Why not come up with a title?  A title is meant to convey something about the image from the photographer, to the viewer.  What are you going for here?It''s an interesting shot, I just wish you had a title.  Needs a bit of contrast, levels/curves adjustment.  Not sure if I have ever seen a little ducky with no eyes.  lol  where did you find that?', '2008-08-15 01:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
