(4891785, 709896, 68797, '<td valign="top">The background is not really attractive and I think the little girls outfit is a bit too busy with all those flowers, whales, hearts, butterflies and colors. It detracts the attention from the ducky.</td>', 'The background is not really attractive and I think the little girls outfit is a bit too busy with all those flowers, whales, hearts, butterflies and colors. It detracts the attention from the ducky.', '2008-08-16 10:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4891792, 708950, 68797, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I''m tempted to say DNMC here. there''s no real ''ducky'' in the shot. And the overall composition and set up is rather poorly done. It''s tilted, tile floor is not nice, and there''s still laundry in the ducky basket. sorry!</td>', 'Hmm, I''m tempted to say DNMC here. there''s no real ''ducky'' in the shot. And the overall composition and set up is rather poorly done. It''s tilted, tile floor is not nice, and there''s still laundry in the ducky basket. sorry!', '2008-08-16 10:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4891800, 709769, 68797, '<td valign="top">somehow the combination of the old pram and the duckies remind of that Batman film with Danny DeVito as Penguin :-D I think the photo itself is a bit dark with all those shadows.</td>', 'somehow the combination of the old pram and the duckies remind of that Batman film with Danny DeVito as Penguin :-D I think the photo itself is a bit dark with all those shadows.', '2008-08-16 10:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4891816, 710130, 68797, '<td valign="top">OK I''m gonna try to give constructive criticism here:<br/>The idea is nice, but you didn''t notice your towelthingy (don''t know the name) had holes on the edges? The bowl has a nice shape. It would''ve been a lot better if you had taken that white cardboard and placed it under the bowl and then bending it upwards (against the wall or something) to create some sort of even background. And a little lower p.o.v. No knife or towel. just my 2 cts.</td>', 'OK I''m gonna try to give constructive criticism here:The idea is nice, but you didn''t notice your towelthingy (don''t know the name) had holes on the edges? The bowl has a nice shape. It would''ve been a lot better if you had taken that white cardboard and placed it under the bowl and then bending it upwards (against the wall or something) to create some sort of even background. And a little lower p.o.v. No knife or towel. just my 2 cts.', '2008-08-16 10:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4891819, 709794, 68797, '<td valign="top">nice composition.</td>', 'nice composition.', '2008-08-16 10:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
