(4891823, 710221, 68797, '<td valign="top">It''s not very sharp, and I would never recognize a surfboard in that pink thing. Composition is also a bit centered.</td>', 'It''s not very sharp, and I would never recognize a surfboard in that pink thing. Composition is also a bit centered.', '2008-08-16 11:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
