(4898144, 709314, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice one!! lighting and comp are great, focus is right where it should be. There is only one thing that (imo) I would have done diff, was made the lights on the adult baby a bit more dim (the pink on black is really contrasty) to really bring the attention strait to the duck, but thats me.....screwin stuff up!! Other than that this image is my fav so far, Nice Work!! Good Luck!! 10</td>', 'Nice one!! lighting and comp are great, focus is right where it should be. There is only one thing that (imo) I would have done diff, was made the lights on the adult baby a bit more dim (the pink on black is really contrasty) to really bring the attention strait to the duck, but thats me.....screwin stuff up!! Other than that this image is my fav so far, Nice Work!! Good Luck!! 10', '2008-08-19 21:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
