(4898721, 709820, 61651, '<td valign="top">Yay!  I was one of your 10s, thought this was absolutely brilliant.  Now that you mention it, definitely see the influence of jjbeguin''s shot.      At the time, I thought this was an unusual take - post-Cold War duckies - and well-processed to get that point across.</td>', 'Yay!  I was one of your 10s, thought this was absolutely brilliant.  Now that you mention it, definitely see the influence of jjbeguin''s shot.      At the time, I thought this was an unusual take - post-Cold War duckies - and well-processed to get that point across.', '2008-08-20 01:10:37.000000', NULL, 0),
