(4898831, 709959, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this didn''t do much better.  Good clarity and exposure.  Beautiful colors, too.  There''s something dramatic (yet humorous) about this I can''t put my finger on.  (Btw, I was one of your 9 votes and almost bumped it to a 10.)</td>', 'I''m surprised this didn''t do much better.  Good clarity and exposure.  Beautiful colors, too.  There''s something dramatic (yet humorous) about this I can''t put my finger on.  (Btw, I was one of your 9 votes and almost bumped it to a 10.)', '2008-08-20 01:25:42.000000', NULL, 0),
