(4898896, 709503, 85097, '<td valign="top">way to go Daniel! nice finish and score.</td>', 'way to go Daniel! nice finish and score.', '2008-08-20 01:32:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4898905, 710162, 67697, '<td valign="top">You are having fun with the funky lighting thing, aren''t you?  I love how the ducks glow.  You should try and turn this into some kind of valentine card - could be kind of interesting.</td>', 'You are having fun with the funky lighting thing, aren''t you?  I love how the ducks glow.  You should try and turn this into some kind of valentine card - could be kind of interesting.', '2008-08-20 01:34:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4898928, 710076, 67697, '<td valign="top">after I read the last comment you received, a word popped into my head that I have not used since grade school:  whir-dey... and we used it to put emphasis on all meanings behind the word "DUH".  It''s too bad that someone could not tell from the image that you had a glowing duck.  I''m sure that if you had titled it "duck" that it would have been much clearer and garnered you some more votes.  Think about it, man...<br/> <br/>I do like the simplicity of this photo and the duck has a nice glow about it too.</td>', 'after I read the last comment you received, a word popped into my head that I have not used since grade school:  whir-dey... and we used it to put emphasis on all meanings behind the word "DUH".  It''s too bad that someone could not tell from the image that you had a glowing duck.  I''m sure that if you had titled it "duck" that it would have been much clearer and garnered you some more votes.  Think about it, man... I do like the simplicity of this photo and the duck has a nice glow about it too.', '2008-08-20 01:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4898936, 710098, 67697, '<td valign="top">oooh I want one of these.  Very cool looking.  I love the DOF you used and how it makes the duck head look like it''s about to pop out of the picture.</td>', 'oooh I want one of these.  Very cool looking.  I love the DOF you used and how it makes the duck head look like it''s about to pop out of the picture.', '2008-08-20 01:40:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4898950, 710128, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m impressed by your description of what you did with the jello to achieve this. I thought it was just bubbles in the tub, but then the whole point of good special effects is to fool the viewer, right? I''d like to know what you used for your homemade diffusers. As you can tell from my own entry, I have a little problem with glare on metal. BTW, I''m really surprised this came in below mine, but then I''m one of the people who gave it a 6.<br/> <br/>added: Just read the in-voting comments. Noticed two differing opinions on the lighting. I''ve gotten a few opposite comments like that. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-20 00:49:07.</i></td>', 'I''m impressed by your description of what you did with the jello to achieve this. I thought it was just bubbles in the tub, but then the whole point of good special effects is to fool the viewer, right? I''d like to know what you used for your homemade diffusers. As you can tell from my own entry, I have a little problem with glare on metal. BTW, I''m really surprised this came in below mine, but then I''m one of the people who gave it a 6. added: Just read the in-voting comments. Noticed two differing opinions on the lighting. I''ve gotten a few opposite comments like that. ', '2008-08-20 01:44:25.000000', '2008-08-20 01:49:07.000000', 0),
(4898986, 710248, 79955, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot , well deserved blue &amp; what a great score. Congrats !!</td>', 'Excellent shot , well deserved blue & what a great score. Congrats !!', '2008-08-20 01:51:10.000000', NULL, 0),
